 - Contributors may only modify tasks assigned to themselves, and may not reassign tasks. Managers may modify any task.
 - Only managers may delete tasks.
 - Archived projects reject all writes with 409 (reads still work).
+- Freezing (`POST /projects/{pid}/freeze`) is allowed only for managers of the project (others 403; archived → 409).
+  It demotes every member, managers included, to `viewer` and marks the project frozen. The response lists the
+  members after the change, sorted by user ID. Frozen projects reject all task writes: as viewers, members get 403,
+  and the frozen flag itself rejects writes with 409. Freezing is not reversible through the API.
 - A task ID that does not belong to the project in the path → 404.
 
